#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:18
msgid "Integrating with VMware Clouds"
msgstr "Integrating con VMware Clouds"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:20
msgid ""
"Integration with a VMware Cloud requires the Cloud integration to be pre-"
"existing. If you need to integrate a VMware Cloud first, refer to the "
"`VMware Cloud integration guide "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/vmware.html>`_"
" in |morpheus| UI documentation for full details. If you are creating the "
"VMware Cloud now, bear in mind that you will need to update firewall inbound"
" rules to allow the |morpheus| appliance to connect with VMware. If this "
"step is not done, any attempts to create that Cloud integration will fail. "
"Log into the NSX Cloud web console and click on the Security tab. Within the"
" security tab, go to the Gateway Firewall section and the Management Gateway"
" tab within it. Edit the list of sources for your vCenter inbound rules. The"
" IP address for the |morpheus| appliance should be among the allowed inbound"
" addresses."
msgstr ""
"Integration con un VMware Cloud requires el Cloud integration to be pre-"
"existente. If you need to integrate un VMware Cloud primero, refer to el "
"`VMware Cloud integration guide "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/vmware.html>`_"
" in |morpheus| UI documentación para full detalles. If you son creating el "
"VMware Cloud ahora, bear in mind que you será need to update firewall "
"inbound rules to allow el |morpheus| appliance to connect con VMware. If "
"este paso no es done, cualquier attempts to create que Cloud integration "
"será fail. Log en el NSX Cloud web console y click on el Security pestaña. "
"Within el security pestaña, go to el Gateway Firewall sección y el "
"Management Gateway pestaña dentro de it. Edit el lista of sources para your "
"vCenter inbound rules. The IP dirección para el |morpheus| appliance debería"
" be among el allowed inbound addresses."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:22
msgid ""
"To begin a new NSX Cloud integration, navigate to |InfNetInt|. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD` and then click \"NSX Cloud\". Make the following "
"configurations to create the integration with NSX Cloud:"
msgstr ""
"To begin un nuevo NSX Cloud integration, navigate to |InfNetInt|. Click "
":guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` y entonces click \"NSX Cloud\". Make el following "
"configurations to create la integración con NSX Cloud:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:24
msgid "**NAME:** A friendly name for the NSX Cloud integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"**NAME:** A friendly nombre para el NSX Cloud integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:25
msgid ""
"**VISIBILITY:** This option is only available from the |mastertenant|. "
"Select \"Public\" to make the NSX Cloud integration available to all "
"Tenants. Select \"Private\" to reserve the integration for the "
"|mastertenant|"
msgstr ""
"**VISIBILITY:** This opción es solo disponible desde el |mastertenant|. "
"Select \"Public\" to make el NSX Cloud integration disponible to todos "
"Tenants. Select \"Private\" to reserve la integración para el |mastertenant|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:26
msgid ""
"**API HOST:** The API access URL for NSX Cloud. Your API URL will look "
"something like this: https://nsx-xx-xx-xx-xx.rp.vmwarevmc.com/vmc/reverse-"
"proxy/api/orgs/xxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxx/sddcs/xxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-"
"xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxx"
msgstr ""
"**API HOST:** The API acceso URL para NSX Cloud. Your API URL será look "
"something like este: https://nsx-xx-xx-xx-xx.rp.vmwarevmc.com/vmc/reverse-"
"proxy/api/orgs/xxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxx/sddcs/xxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-"
"xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxx"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:27
msgid ""
"**API KEY:** An API token granting sufficient access for |morpheus| to work "
"with all relevant NSX constructs"
msgstr ""
"**API KEY:** An API token granting sufficient acceso para |morpheus| to work"
" con todos relevante NSX constructs"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:28
msgid ""
"**CLOUD:** Select the VMware Cloud integration that NSX Cloud should "
"integrate with"
msgstr ""
"**CLOUD:** Seleccione el VMware Cloud integration que NSX Cloud debería "
"integrate con"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:30
msgid ""
"Once done, click :guilabel:`ADD NETWORK INTEGRATION`. After a brief moment, "
"the new integration will be created and will appear alongside other network "
"integrations on the network integration list page. We can verify that NSX "
"Cloud and the VMware Cloud are integrated by editing the VMware Cloud "
"(|InfClo| > Selected VMware Cloud > EDIT button). Expand the Advanced "
"Options panel of the EDIT CLOUD modal and the NSX Cloud integration should "
"be set under the NETWORK MODE configuration."
msgstr ""
"Once done, click :guilabel:`AGREGAR RED INTEGRATION`. After un brief moment,"
" el nuevo integration será creado y será appear alongside otro network "
"integrations on la red integration página de lista. We puede verify que NSX "
"Cloud y el VMware Cloud son integrated by editing el VMware Cloud (|InfClo| "
"> Selected VMware Cloud > EDIT botón). Expand el Advanced Options panel of "
"el EDIT CLOUD modal y el NSX Cloud integration debería be set under el "
"NETWORK MODE configuración."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:33
msgid "Managing NSX Cloud"
msgstr "Administrar NSX Cloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxCloud.rst:35
msgid ""
"With the integration complete, you can now examine the detail section for "
"the new integration. From the network integration list page (|InfNetInt|), "
"select the NSX Cloud integration that was just created. From this section, "
"we can create, manage, and delete DHCP servers and relays, network segments,"
" firewall rules, tier-1 routers, and groups."
msgstr ""
"With la integración completo, you puede ahora examine el detalle sección "
"para el nuevo integration. Desde el network integration página de lista "
"(|InfNetInt|), select el NSX Cloud integration que fue solo creado. From "
"este sección, we puede create, manage, y delete DHCP servers y relays, "
"network segments, firewall rules, tier-1 routers, y groups."
